  "body": "I m testing shared worker.\n\n1) unload event is not working. It is usefull for saving state in server before of unloading\n2) message channel port has not onclose event. It is difficult to keep the state of clients connected. \n3) shared worker seams not working if you reload a single page. When browser is opening a page in a domain X  and then user  reload , coming from same domain, it might reuse the same shared worker. In this way in the case of realoading the same page , it works. \n",
